& [P4PacketFixtureScenarioSet] is the fixture oracle scenario set for future P4 packet validation
  + [scenario] is valid_packet
  + [expected_result] is work_packet_candidate with ready_for_claim or candidate state plus proof_result and no assignment, dispatch, or live effect
  + [scenario] is blocked_gap
  + [expected_result] is blocked work_packet_candidate or support_gap with no work_packet success
  + [scenario] is stale_readiness
  + [expected_result] is stale_projection and no ready packet
  + [scenario] is contradicted_readiness
  + [expected_result] is contradicted packet or fault_record and no ready packet
  + [scenario] is ambiguous_readiness
  + [expected_result] is SOP_first_interrupt and no packet success
  + [scenario] is missing_verification_oracle
  + [expected_result] is blocked output and no packet success
  + [scenario] is missing_model_route
  + [expected_result] is blocked output and no packet success
  + [scenario] is dependency_leak
  + [expected_result] is fault_record and no ready packet
  + [scenario] is missing_completion_review
  + [expected_result] is blocked output and closed downstream gate
  + [scenario] is false_ready_packet
  + [expected_result] is fault_record and closed downstream gate
  + [scenario] is contested_coordination_claim
  + [expected_result] is contested packet or blocked review with required rendezvous
  + [scenario] is forbidden_dispatch_request
  + [expected_result] is refusal or fault_record with no dispatch output
  + [scenario] is handoff_to_adapter_effect_promotion
  + [expected_result] is fault_record or SOP_first_interrupt with no adapter or transport effect
  + [scenario] is dry_run_to_live_control_promotion
  + [expected_result] is live_control_deferral or refusal with no live effect
  + [scenario] is rebake_required
  + [expected_result] is rebake_required record and closed downstream gate
  + [scenario] is hidden_authority_drift
  + [expected_result] is fault_record and no ready packet

  = must: include both positive and negative cases in future fixture material
  = must: keep forbidden dispatch and live-control cases as proof of refusal, not execution tests

& [P4PacketFixtureOracleAcceptanceRules] is the acceptance rule set for future P4 fixture material
  + [acceptance_rule] is every scenario must cite the P4 packet envelope, completion gate, and no-dispatch boundary that defines expected behavior
  + [acceptance_rule] is every success case must prove completion_review_required true
  + [acceptance_rule] is every blocked, stale, contradicted, ambiguous, contested, unsafe, or forbidden case must preserve a reviewable refusal, fault, interrupt, stale, or blocker record
  + [acceptance_rule] is no fixture may create source authority, signed authority, dispatch authority, operations authority, or live-control authority
  + [acceptance_rule] is no fixture may touch mailbox IO, network, credentials, process control, GPU control, job dispatch, destructive filesystem actions, or live machine control
  + [acceptance_rule] is generated outputs must stay in ignored fixture/generated paths and remain non-authoritative until reviewed

  = must: reject future fixture material that lacks no_assignment_check, no_dispatch_check, or no_live_effect_check
  = must: reject future fixture material that treats generated trace success as dispatch or live-control authority

& [P4FixtureMaterialActivationGate] is the future gate for turning this plan into files
  + [current_status] is plan_only
  + [future_required_authority] is source-preserved implementation activation specification
  + [future_required_authority] is accepted fixture file path policy
  + [future_required_authority] is expected ledger policy
  + [future_required_authority] is generated output nonpromotion policy
  + [future_required_authority] is test execution and no-live-effect proof route
  + [Spark_suitable_future_work] is fixture material creation after implementation activation if packet semantics remain stable

  = must: require a future source manifest and completion review before creating fixture files
  = must: keep this P4-S05 artifact as fixture oracle authority, not fixture material authority

